---
id: handler_repair
title: The living repair bench
---
=== bench
~ entries += 1
A moth and a little brass bell wait on the workbench.
* [Repair the moth] { !inventory.moth }
  ~ work = 1
  ~ repair
  ~ work += 1
  -> bench
* [Release the moth] { inventory.moth && work == 11 }
  ~ release
  -> window
* [Try a refused repair]
  ~ repair
  ~ reject
  ~ work = 999
  -> bench
* [Try an unknown handler]
  ~ repair
  ~ unknown
  -> bench
=== window
The moth flies through the open window.
* [Return]
  -> bench
